{"4408990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Major Mutt", "steam_appid": 4408990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>HOW LONG WILL YOU LAST?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Major Mutt is a roguelike bullet heaven game where you battle endless swarms of oversized insects and other critters across procedurally generated maps. Level up your dog-soldier, upgrade devastating weapons, and see how long you can survive the onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>THE GOODEST BOY IN THE APOCALYPSE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't just a survivor, you're a working dog! While the automated turrets on your harness shred incoming swarms, use your instincts to find and guide lost sheep to the exits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SHEEP HERDING = GROWTH</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408990/extras/62205fac67503e802807292aa16e45da.poster.avif?t=1779592463\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408990/extras/62205fac67503e802807292aa16e45da.webm?t=1779592463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408990/extras/62205fac67503e802807292aa16e45da.mp4?t=1779592463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving the flock isn't just for points. Every sheep successfully herded to an exit rewards you with <strong>permanent stat boosts</strong> for the duration of your run. The more you save, the more powerful you become. Will you play it safe, or dive into the swarm to rescue one last lamb?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>UPGRADE. EVOLVE. DOMINATE.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush enemies to collect Bone XP and level up. The more you slay, the stronger you become. Every upgrade is randomized and comes in different rarities, ensuring no two runs ever feel the same.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>HOW LONG WILL YOU LAST?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Major Mutt is a roguelike bullet heaven game where you battle endless swarms of oversized insects and other critters across procedurally generated maps. Level up your dog-soldier, upgrade devastating weapons, and see how long you can survive the onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>THE GOODEST BOY IN THE APOCALYPSE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't just a survivor, you're a working dog! While the automated turrets on your harness shred incoming swarms, use your instincts to find and guide lost sheep to the exits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SHEEP HERDING = GROWTH</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408990/extras/62205fac67503e802807292aa16e45da.poster.avif?t=1779592463\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408990/extras/62205fac67503e802807292aa16e45da.webm?t=1779592463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408990/extras/62205fac67503e802807292aa16e45da.mp4?t=1779592463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving the flock isn't just for points. Every sheep successfully herded to an exit rewards you with <strong>permanent stat boosts</strong> for the duration of your run. The more you save, the more powerful you become. Will you play it safe, or dive into the swarm to rescue one last lamb?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>UPGRADE. EVOLVE. DOMINATE.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush enemies to collect Bone XP and level up. The more you slay, the stronger you become. Every upgrade is randomized and comes in different rarities, ensuring no two runs ever feel the same.</p>", "short_description": "Play as a combat ready pup in this 3D survivorlike. Blast through swarms of giant critters with auto firing weapons attached to your harness, but don't just survive, Do Your Job! Herd lost sheep to safety to earn permanent stat boosts and become the ultimate Good Boy", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408990/1db5afda2c9446645b17a0943026c327f0fa6633/header.jpg?t=1779592463", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408990/32441ac180135459502d35654178dd727b507178/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779592463", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4408990/32441ac180135459502d35654178dd727b507178/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779592463", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Vongo Forge"], "publishers": ["Vongo Forge"], "demos": [{"appid": 4575380, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms